[i]A cold sweat wakes you up. You have a sudden, sinking feeling, that something terrible had just happened.
[i]But... you can't figure out what...
[i]Rain pounds on the roof of the building you're in... it's unrelenting
[i]As you navigate through the rooms, you soon realize you're in a college residence hall.
[i]It's strange... you feel like you know this place like the back of your hand.
[i]In what seems to be a dining area, strangley well-kept... you find a journal...
